---
import FillButton from "../ui/FillButton.astro"
import GhostButton from "../ui/GhostButton.astro"
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import placeholderImg from '../../assets/img/placeholder.jpg';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---

<section id="hero" class="hero-section navy__band">

    <div class="hero-image">
        <Image src={placeholderImg} alt="Placeholder hero photo" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    </div>

    <div class="hero-information">
        <h1>Why <em>Allegheny College</em> Computer & Information Science?</h1>
        <div class="hero-information__body">
            <p>
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus id egestas nibh, ac elementum velit. Donec aliquam eu ligula ac facilisis.
            </p>
            <p>
                Mauris vel fermentum dui, ac semper lorem. Cras scelerisque dictum risus, sed hendrerit ante. Donec in sodales nisl. Fusce sed quam arcu. Donec mollis nisi sit amet mi hendrerit, sed dictum erat vestibulum. Maecenas vel risus elit. Pellentesque maximus felis eu ligula congue posuere.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-buttons">
                <a href="/plan/mypath"><FillButton>Plan Your Path Here</FillButton></a>
                <a href={`${base}plan/degrees`}><GhostButton>Our Programs</GhostButton></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>